VALUES ('teacher-competency', 'tc-professional', 'Professional Learning', 'tc-pl-create', 'Create', 'bdc-teacher-he', 'bdc-learning-development', 'Digital Learning and Development (Element 5)', 'bdc-ld-proficient', 'Proficient', 'strong', 'unidirectional_source_implies_target', 'CFT Professional Learning Create requires facilitating AI professional development programmes. BDC Element 5 at Proficient level involves leading organisational change projects in response to digital developments and facilitating colleagues'' digital capability development. Both involve professional development leadership and programme facilitation.', ARRAY['Design and facilitation of technology-focused professional development', 'Leadership of colleagues'' digital capability development', 'Evaluation of professional development impact'], ARRAY['CFT''s AI-specific programme content', 'BDC''s broader digital change leadership (VLE migration, online learning transformation, digital assessment introduction)']);

