VALUES ('teacher-competency', 'tc-foundations', 'AI Foundations', 'tc-fo-create', 'Create', 'bdc-teacher-he', 'bdc-creation-innovation', 'Digital Creation, Problem-Solving and Innovation (Element 3)', 'bdc-cpi-proficient', 'Proficient', 'moderate', 'unidirectional_source_implies_target', 'CFT Foundations Create requires designing learning activities about AI principles. BDC Element 3 at Proficient level involves designing interactive learning resources and leading innovation projects. Both involve creating digital educational resources and innovating in educational practice.', ARRAY['Design of original digital learning resources', 'Innovation leadership in educational technology'], ARRAY['CFT''s focus on AI-principles-as-content (teaching about AI itself)', 'BDC''s broader digital creation skills (coding, app development, virtual environments, multimedia production)']);

